{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>已故富商林百欣孫女、麗新集團主席林建岳與前妻謝玲玲的長女林恬兒（Emily），今年8月傳出與何柱國兒子何正德（Kent）12年婚姻觸礁，男方被爆在加拿大街頭高調攬錫新歡，而林恬兒與JW（王灝兒）舊愛葉韋彤（Tarzan）的慶生合照早前亦遭盜用流出，兩人隔空發聲明交鋒，日前林恬兒更將IG帳戶名稱由原本的「emilylam.ho」改為「emilylam」，正式「除夫姓」劃清界線。適逢感恩節，林恬兒在社交平台大曬於豪宅親自籌備的感恩節晚宴，並曬出與一對子女的溫馨合照，相比起去年同一地點一家四口齊齊整整的畫面，如今已物是人非。</p><figure><img alt=\"林恬兒與何正德曾經恩愛。（IG@emilylam）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260720/1155824140612145152074296.jpeg/S5rQ9kTJeTn5XOP7gIHp-zPh_31mmJpZo50EX6OdBF8\"/><figcaption>林恬兒與何正德曾經恩愛。（IG@emilylam）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"12年婚姻觸礁。（IG@emilylam）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1203069177888509952605429.jpeg/vpgY2SOCLzKrczwgLJciLpaN-JcNH3y9yVsWIclbFiE\"/><figcaption>12年婚姻觸礁。（IG@emilylam）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一家四口。（IG@emilylam）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1203069175677980672897435.jpeg/ZX0VVKctMlhty2Ur_qsmGuFuVpKA34Z6idg9QonYPUI\"/><figcaption>一家四口。（IG@emilylam）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"今年元旦Party最後同框。（IG@emilylam.ho）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260428/1125837837112184832831429.jpeg/xx2eVpTtEVRuZfI7XgBvDXZz3yGLVOpPYb2pqWG9qak\"/><figcaption>今年元旦Party最後同框。（IG@emilylam.ho）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林恬兒將IG帳戶名稱由原本的「emilylam.ho」改為「emilylam」，低調「除夫姓」劃清界線。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261125/1202344877128552448984265.png/kdm4Mo3iKUSDRTNt8I3T-leUAY-IK-G6vDsdqbw7Hak\"/><figcaption>林恬兒將IG帳戶名稱由原本的「emilylam.ho」改為「emilylam」，低調「除夫姓」劃清界線。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"但仍保留過往一家四口及與何正德的夫妻合照，作風相當體面。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261125/1202344874435678208087219.png/C7Wg4aP4pDvTEMDfc7ggA1kqZf1umlcOLyNKzC8jSsw\"/><figcaption>但仍保留過往一家四口及與何正德的夫妻合照，作風相當體面。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林恬兒每年都精心準備感恩節大餐。（IG@emilylam）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1203069173308067840968324.jpeg/yajmpd-k6byuwl7hQmZMPfv5M7oPgz2LlYGq95WBqvc\"/><figcaption>林恬兒每年都精心準備感恩節大餐。（IG@emilylam）</figcaption></figure><p>林恬兒親自準備感恩節大餐　悉心佈置豪宅招呼親友</p><p>林恬兒寫道：「Annual family tradition - Friendsgiving dinner🧡 🦃🍁 no matter what still have a lot to be grateful for this year 🤎 happy thanksgiving 🍽 🍂（一年一度的家庭傳統——感恩節晚餐。無論發生什麼事，今年依然有很多值得感恩的事情，感恩節快樂。）」相中所見，向來注重儀式感的林恬兒，為招呼一眾至親好友，將豪宅飯廳佈置得充滿濃厚秋日氣氛，超長原木餐枱上擺放了橙黃色鮮花、南瓜、松果、麥穗、楓葉及長蠟燭等，每個位置都放有精緻藤編餐墊及蝴蝶結餐巾扣。除了餐枱佈置一絲不苟，林恬兒亦親自準備豐盛的傳統感恩節大餐，開放式廚房中島台上擺滿原隻烤火雞、焗芝士通心粉、粟米批及多款醬汁，並特別訂製了寫有「HAPPY THANKSGIVING」的胡桃批甜品，相當有心思。</p><figure><img alt=\"今年亦親自準備感恩節大餐。（IG@emilylam）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1203068261496262656875963.png/OcgCPSz0XU_3Fo_-GWz1dWT34_XY1qPDrsl-Ma7JfjE\"/><figcaption>今年亦親自準備感恩節大餐。（IG@emilylam）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"將豪宅飯廳佈置得充滿濃厚秋日氣氛。（IG@emilylam）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1203068258778222592072648.jpeg/SSK5EJl7qFA3fsnrlXqW44TE5IIuzzXSOdBgPjnQYD4\"/><figcaption>將豪宅飯廳佈置得充滿濃厚秋日氣氛。（IG@emilylam）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"相當有心思。（IG@emilylam）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1203068255900798976421978.jpeg/qYMihXP38o-FpORYlx_OTDiVkJpVQvtR1NONRNTTjUQ\"/><figcaption>相當有心思。（IG@emilylam）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"儀式感滿滿。（IG@emilylam）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1203068252897546240342109.jpeg/Ls7a7m5c0CWfEpPQmi6cFU2VB9hFwRp7O7mJjTu5iY0\"/><figcaption>儀式感滿滿。（IG@emilylam）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"當然唔少得火雞。（IG@emilylam）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1203068218743197696467085.jpeg/l8fkhEc794j3zIYJawgOcXiWebQz9E8FQMBez0DAXs8\"/><figcaption>當然唔少得火雞。（IG@emilylam）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"甜品。（IG@emilylam）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1203068249877516288805139.jpeg/YbMMSw1hqtcHc6h_MX305tR6fhOfOQQYUsb1uVLG9bk\"/><figcaption>甜品。（IG@emilylam）</figcaption></figure><p>林恬兒攬實子女合照場面溫馨　去年一家四口慶祝物是人非</p><p>身穿啡色麂皮褸襯牛仔褲的林恬兒，展露甜美笑容，狀態極佳，她亦有曬出與一對仔女的合照，相中她坐在餐椅上，雙手攬實囡囡同囝囝，母子三人依偎在一起十分溫馨。然而，翻查林恬兒去年感恩節在同一個飯廳拍下的合照，當時前夫何正德站在她身旁，一家四口同框笑容燦爛。事隔一年，男主人已缺席，但林恬兒與一對子女過節，依然開心美滿！</p><figure><img alt=\"狀態極佳。（IG@emilylam）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1203068072987201536482391.jpeg/OnsC5nGmqq5QGzB4C3bncvsbZry9I7ljs-Jzr7Pic68\"/><figcaption>狀態極佳。（IG@emilylam）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"展露笑容。（IG@emilylam）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1203068070218829824659187.jpeg/RnTyJGhzU8YcdFm2XJlowG-Dse8v6c1DIhvS2iIb0to\"/><figcaption>展露笑容。（IG@emilylam）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"攬實子女合照場面溫馨。（IG@emilylam）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1203068066938753024359016.jpeg/DfasGL0KKnTWh1360OdVABxXpqSganezxckNr8XJDa8\"/><figcaption>攬實子女合照場面溫馨。（IG@emilylam）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"去年感恩節。（IG@emilylam）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1203067953986408448968715.jpeg/p7qinKTUfrAswiy22-cGugh0KFk9mtT1XJ-bAVyfmwE\"/><figcaption>去年感恩節。（IG@emilylam）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一家四口慶祝。（IG@emilylam）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1203067951679410176783021.jpeg/q-EwnvyWUGtmzXOpkzTj2JwKQ4zeWyyK9xQBdPcUAXQ\"/><figcaption>一家四口慶祝。（IG@emilylam）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林恬兒與一對子女。（IG@emilylam）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1203067949129142272981702.jpeg/KVWF54taKlKn9ty-bxgBZzJ03WNtw9gVh3_x94d_8fc\"/><figcaption>林恬兒與一對子女。（IG@emilylam）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T12:24:15.481358+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1350,"images":19,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T12:00:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T12:37:28.963100+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T12:17:33.654762+00:00","content_hash":"b715bdc5015d2346710e3310841818e2f5d06e6556df8979da928911066f61ae","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}